## Key Cross-Cutting Rules

1. [e.g. No repository classes in the backend. Services call the ORM directly.]
2. [e.g. No global state library in the frontend. State lives in ViewModel hooks.]
3. [e.g. No cross-feature imports. Features import from shared/ only.]
4. [e.g. All routes live in frontend/src/app/App.tsx.]
5. [e.g. Permission constants must stay in sync between backend and frontend.]
6. **`tsc --noEmit` must pass before any change is considered complete.**
7. **Never use PowerShell to write or modify any project file.** Use the write tool (fs_write) or str_replace. Use shell only for running commands.

