## Test Commands

```bash
# Backend
cd backend && npm run test:unit
cd backend && npm run test:e2e

# Frontend
cd frontend && npx vitest run

# TypeScript check
cd backend && npx tsc --noEmit
cd frontend && npx tsc --noEmit --project tsconfig.app.json
```

